distance	<mml:math id="M53"><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mover accent="true"><mml:mi>d</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="true">&#x002dc;</mml:mo></mml:mover></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mi>L</mml:mi><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:msub></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mtext>&#x00394;</mml:mtext><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>&#x003b4;</mml:mi><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mtext>&#x00394;</mml:mtext><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>&#x003b4;</mml:mi><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:math> as function of quantization levels for boththe values (axis labeled &#x0201c;<italic>Dx</italic>&#x0201d;) and the time (axis labeled&#x0201c;delta t&#x0201d;).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BSB2007-82702.009"/></fig><fig id="F10" position="float"><label>Figure 10</label><caption><p>Resultsfor the second simulation: the vertical axis shows the distance<mml:math id="M54"><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mover accent="true"><mml:mi>d</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="true">&#x002dc;</mml:mo></mml:mover></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mi>L</mml:mi><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:msub></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mtext>&#x00394;</mml:mtext><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>&#x003b4;</mml:mi><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>f</mml:mi><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msub><mml:mtext>&#x00394;</mml:mtext><mml:mi>x</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mn>0</mml:mn><mml:mo>,</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>&#x003b4;</mml:mi><mml:mi>t</mml:mi></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:msub></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:mrow></mml:math> as function of quantization levels for boththe values (labeled &#x0201c;&#x00394;<sub><italic>x</italic></sub>&#x0201d;) and the time (labeled &#x0201c;<italic>&#x003b4;<sub>t</sub></italic>&#x0201d;).Part (a) shows the distance as a function of &#x00394;<sub><italic>x</italic></sub>for several values of <italic>&#x003b4;<sub>t</sub></italic>. Part (b) shows the distance as afunction of <italic>&#x003b4;<sub>t</sub></italic>for several values of &#x00394;<sub><italic>x</italic></sub>.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BSB2007-82702.010"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Parameter values used in simulations.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Parameter</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Value</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Parameter</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Value</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Affinity constant</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003b8;</italic> = 10<sup>8</sup> M<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of binding sites</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>S</italic> = 1</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">mRNA and protein half-life</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003c1;</italic> = 1200 s</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Transcription rates</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003ba;</italic><sub>1</sub> = 0.001pMs<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003c0;</italic> = 3600 s</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003ba;</italic><sub>2</sub> = 					 <italic>&#x003ba;</italic><sub>3</sub> =<italic>&#x003ba;</italic><sub>4</sub> 					 = 0.05 pMs<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" colspan="1">Translation rate</td><td rowspan="3" align="center" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003bb;</italic> = 0.20 s<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td rowspan="3" colspan="1">Time delays</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003c4;</italic><sub><italic>r</italic></sub> = 2000 s</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003c4;</italic><sub><italic>c</italic></sub> = 200 s</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>&#x003c4;</italic><sub><italic>p</italic></sub> = 2400 s</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>